# joycon-combine-right-first without R's recentering ButtonUp of east at
# @500: the mirror of joycon-combine-lost-up. Joy-Con (R) holds east on
# its own, and its ButtonUp is dropped because Events was full. Joy-Con
# (L) wakes: SDL replaces R with the pair, so R's removal is the only
# thing that can end the hold, and its ReleaseAll releases Space at @500.
# The pair holds east and loses its ButtonUp too, at @800, when L is
# switched off; R comes back 10 ms later with a new id and its old key.
# The GUIDs and serials are joycon-combine-right-first's; the pair's key
# is its GUID and fixed path.
